---json
{
  "layout": "layouts/base.njk",
  "title": "Our Impact | Get Lagos Now",
  "description": "Explore how Get Lagos Now creates meaningful digital results and supports communities through nonprofit partnerships, technology donations, and responsible business initiatives.",
  "dataPage": "impact",
  "css": [
    "style.css",
    "responsive.css",
    "impact.css"
  ],
  "js": [
    "main.js"
  ],
  "robots": null,
  "themeColor": true,
  "preconnectFonts": true,
  "preconnectSource": true,
  "navComment": null,
  "footerComment": null,
  "footerCredit": "Project, campaign, and community imagery © Get Lagos Now and respective organizations.",
  "nav": {
    "desktop": "impact",
    "mobile": "impact",
    "mobileClass": true,
    "footerCurrent": {
      "explore": "impact.html"
    }
  },
  "cta": {
    "sectionClass": "impact-cta",
    "titleId": "impact-cta-title",
    "title": "Let's Talk.",
    "wrapper": "class",
    "wrapperClass": "impact-cta__main",
    "lineClass": "impact-cta__line",
    "line": "Have a project in mind? Let's create something meaningful together.",
    "href": "contact.html#contact-form",
    "strong": "Start a project",
    "sub": "Portland, Oregon"
  }
}
---

    <!-- 01 Standard inner-page hero: geometry follows the approved Our Work hero. -->
    <section class="inner-page-hero" aria-labelledby="impact-hero-title">
      <div class="container inner-page-hero__grid">
        <div class="inner-page-hero__content reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Our impact</p>
          <h1 id="impact-hero-title" class="inner-page-hero__title">Beyond the screen.<br>Into the world.</h1>
          <p class="inner-page-hero__text">Great work should create meaningful change. From helping organizations achieve their digital goals to supporting communities and sustainable initiatives, we're committed to making a difference where it matters.</p>
          <div class="inner-page-hero__cta">
            <a href="#impact-pathways" class="btn btn--dark">
              <span>Explore Our Impact</span>
              <span class="btn__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 3v10M4 9l4 4 4-4"/></svg></span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="inner-page-hero__visual reveal">
          <figure class="inner-page-hero__primary">
            <img src="assets/images/shared/donations-and-aileena-1024x683.jpg"
                 alt="Community activity at the 2021 E-Recycling PDX event"
                 width="1024" height="683" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
          </figure>
          <figure class="inner-page-hero__detail">
            <img src="assets/images/shared/GLN-assets-pics-681x1024.jpeg"
                 alt="Get Lagos Now materials at a documented E-Recycling PDX event"
                 width="681" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 02 Two ways we make an impact -->
    <section class="impact-pathways section" id="impact-pathways" aria-labelledby="impact-pathways-title">
      <div class="container impact-pathways__grid">
        <div class="impact-pathways__intro reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">What impact means to us</p>
          <h2 id="impact-pathways-title" class="h2">Measured in results.<br>Defined by purpose.</h2>
          <p>We believe impact takes different forms. Sometimes it's helping a business reach new audiences. Sometimes it's putting technology into the hands of someone who needs it. Both matter.</p>
        </div>
        <nav class="impact-pathways__nav" aria-label="Explore impact areas">
          <a class="impact-pathway reveal" href="#digital-impact">
            <span class="impact-pathway__number">01</span>
            <span class="impact-pathway__copy">
              <strong>Digital Impact</strong>
              <span>Meaningful marketing performance, digital growth, improved visibility, and effective experiences for our clients.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="impact-pathway__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
          </a>
          <a class="impact-pathway reveal" href="#community-impact">
            <span class="impact-pathway__number">02</span>
            <span class="impact-pathway__copy">
              <strong>Community &amp; Environmental Impact</strong>
              <span>Nonprofit partnerships, technology donations, sustainability initiatives, and community involvement.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="impact-pathway__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 03 Digital impact: historical examples from the official Impact page. -->
    <section class="digital-impact" id="digital-impact" aria-labelledby="digital-impact-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="digital-impact__feature">
          <div class="digital-impact__lead reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Digital impact</p>
            <h2 id="digital-impact-title" class="h2 h2--light">Results that move organizations forward.</h2>
            <p>Strategy is only meaningful when it delivers value. Through research, digital advertising, optimization, and thoughtful execution, we help organizations strengthen their online presence and reach the people who matter.</p>
            <p class="digital-impact__source">Historical campaign examples published on the original Get Lagos Now Impact page.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="digital-impact__primary reveal">
            <img src="assets/images/shared/pixel-results-1024x640.png"
                 alt="Google Analytics, retargeting, and display advertising campaign example published by Get Lagos Now"
                 width="1024" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <figcaption><span>Campaign example</span><span>Analytics &middot; Retargeting &middot; Display</span></figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="digital-impact__cases">
          <article class="digital-case digital-case--analytics reveal">
            <figure class="digital-case__media">
              <img src="assets/images/shared/pixel-results-1024x640.png"
                   alt="Published campaign results graphic for analytics, retargeting, and display advertising"
                   width="1024" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </figure>
            <div class="digital-case__body">
              <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Campaign example</p>
              <h3>Google Analytics, retargeting &amp; display ads</h3>
              <p>An example of campaign reporting shared on the original Impact page. Figures shown belong to the published historical source image; no new performance claim is made here.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="digital-case digital-case--ups reveal">
            <figure class="digital-case__media">
              <img src="assets/images/shared/UPS-Google-reviews-892x1024.png"
                   alt="Google Business Profile SEO results graphic for the Washington Square UPS Store, as published by Get Lagos Now"
                   width="892" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </figure>
            <div class="digital-case__body">
              <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Local search example</p>
              <h3>Washington Square UPS Store</h3>
              <p>The original Impact page presents this as a Google Business Profile SEO management example.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 04 Purpose beyond profit -->
    <section class="impact-purpose section" aria-labelledby="impact-purpose-title">
      <div class="container impact-purpose__grid">
        <div class="impact-purpose__copy reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Purpose beyond profit</p>
          <h2 id="impact-purpose-title" class="h2">Doing good is part<br>of how we do business.</h2>
          <p class="impact-purpose__text">We believe business success should go hand in hand with responsibility. Our commitments extend beyond the digital work we deliver to include nonprofit support, community involvement, and more sustainable practices.</p>
          <figure class="impact-purpose__photo">
            <img src="assets/images/shared/Blanchet-House-Mural.jpeg"
                 alt="Mural at Blanchet House, a Portland nonprofit supported by Get Lagos Now"
                 width="1024" height="683" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <figcaption>Blanchet House &amp; Farm, Portland</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <div class="impact-purpose__figures reveal">
          <article class="impact-figure impact-figure--commitment">
            <p class="eyebrow">Ongoing commitment</p>
            <p class="impact-figure__number">5%<span>+</span></p>
            <h3>Annual profit-giving commitment</h3>
            <p>Get Lagos Now publishes a commitment to contribute 5%+ of business profits to local nonprofits through cash and in-kind donations. This is a commitment, not a reported yearly total.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="impact-figure impact-figure--result">
            <p class="eyebrow">Documented result &middot; 2024</p>
            <p class="impact-figure__number">19.6<span>%</span></p>
            <h3>Of profits donated in 2024</h3>
            <p>The 2024 Annual Benefit Report records this share of company profits contributed to local nonprofits through cash and new technology donations.</p>
            <a href="reports/annual-benefit-2024.html" class="impact-inline-link">Read the 2024 report <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
          </article>
          <p class="impact-purpose__fine">These figures refer to different things: 5%+ is the published annual commitment; 19.6% is the result reported for 2024.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 05 Areas of impact: real initiatives, not stock depictions. -->
    <section class="impact-areas section" id="community-impact" aria-labelledby="impact-areas-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="impact-areas__head reveal">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Our areas of impact</p>
            <h2 id="impact-areas-title" class="h2">Small actions.<br>Meaningful change.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Making a positive difference means finding practical ways to support people, strengthen communities, and make better use of valuable resources.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="impact-areas__grid">
          <article class="impact-area impact-area--community reveal">
            <figure class="impact-area__media">
              <img src="assets/images/shared/Gary-and-Michelle-donate-1024x768.jpg"
                   alt="Gary Dunsworth and Michelle Lagos donating technology to Rose Haven with Executive Director Katie O'Brien in January 2021"
                   width="1024" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </figure>
            <div class="impact-area__copy">
              <span class="impact-area__number">01</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Supporting communities</h3>
                <p>Contributing resources, time, and practical support to local nonprofit organizations serving people facing hardship.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="impact-area impact-area--access reveal">
            <figure class="impact-area__media">
              <img src="assets/images/shared/new-avenues-12.21-donation-rotated.jpg"
                   alt="Michelle Lagos and Sean Suib of New Avenues for Youth at a documented technology donation in December 2021"
                   width="480" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </figure>
            <div class="impact-area__copy">
              <span class="impact-area__number">02</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Expanding digital access</h3>
                <p>Technology donation initiatives help refurbished devices reach people and community organizations that can use them.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="impact-area impact-area--planet reveal">
            <figure class="impact-area__media">
              <img src="assets/images/shared/destroying-hardrives.jpeg"
                   alt="Hard drive destruction as part of a documented E-Recycling PDX event"
                   width="1024" height="683" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </figure>
            <div class="impact-area__copy">
              <span class="impact-area__number">03</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Supporting a healthier planet</h3>
                <p>Promoting responsible reuse and recycling of electronic devices to help reduce unnecessary electronic waste.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 06 E-Recycling PDX -->
    <section class="impact-recycling" id="e-recycling" aria-labelledby="recycling-title">
      <div class="container">
        <figure class="impact-recycling__wide reveal">
          <img src="assets/images/shared/Laughing-in-the-mask.jpeg"
               alt="Community participants at the first E-Recycling PDX event in 2020"
               width="1024" height="683" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <figcaption><span>E-Recycling PDX</span><span>Community event, 2020</span></figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="impact-recycling__story">
          <div class="impact-recycling__lead reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">Featured initiative</p>
            <h2 id="recycling-title" class="h2">Giving technology<br>a second life.</h2>
            <p>Through E-Recycling PDX, Get Lagos Now and its partners work to extend the useful life of electronic devices, encourage responsible recycling, and help refurbished technology reach people and organizations that need it.</p>
            <p class="impact-recycling__report-note">The 2025 Annual Benefit Report describes the sixth annual event and donations benefiting Rose Haven and Raphael House. The 2024 report documents separate device donations by recipient.</p>
            <a href="reports/e-recycling-pdx.html" class="btn btn--dark" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span>Explore E-Recycling PDX <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></span>
              <span class="btn__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="impact-recycling__collage">
            <figure class="impact-recycling__detail impact-recycling__detail--portrait reveal">
              <img src="assets/images/shared/Michelle-donates-768x1024.jpg"
                   alt="Michelle Lagos making a documented technology donation to Raphael House"
                   width="768" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              <figcaption>Technology donation &middot; 2021</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure class="impact-recycling__detail impact-recycling__detail--landscape reveal">
              <img src="assets/images/shared/Event-2021-bottles-1024x683.jpg"
                   alt="Materials and collection activity at the 2021 E-Recycling PDX event"
                   width="1024" height="683" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              <figcaption>E-Recycling PDX &middot; 2021</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 07 Organizations with documented support -->
    <section class="impact-recipients section" aria-labelledby="recipients-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="impact-recipients__head reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Community connections</p>
          <h2 id="recipients-title" class="h2">The organizations<br>making a difference.</h2>
          <p>We're proud to contribute to organizations working to create stronger communities, improve access to resources, and support individuals facing difficult circumstances.</p>
          <span class="impact-recipients__note">Documented device donations &middot; 2024 Annual Benefit Report</span>
        </header>

        <ul class="recipient-list">
          <li class="recipient-row reveal">
            <span class="recipient-row__num">01</span>
            <a href="https://blanchethouse.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="recipient-row__name">Blanchet House<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
            <p class="recipient-row__fact">The 2024 report records 3 laptops and 2 iPads donated to Blanchet House.</p>
            <span class="recipient-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
          </li>
          <li class="recipient-row reveal">
            <span class="recipient-row__num">02</span>
            <a href="https://rosehaven.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="recipient-row__name">Rose Haven<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
            <p class="recipient-row__fact">The 2024 report records 3 iPads and 3 cellphones donated to Rose Haven.</p>
            <span class="recipient-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
          </li>
          <li class="recipient-row reveal">
            <span class="recipient-row__num">03</span>
            <a href="https://raphaelhouse.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="recipient-row__name">Raphael House<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
            <p class="recipient-row__fact">The 2024 report records 4 laptops and 1 Chromebook donated to Raphael House.</p>
            <span class="recipient-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
          </li>
          <li class="recipient-row reveal">
            <span class="recipient-row__num">04</span>
            <a href="https://newavenues.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="recipient-row__name">New Avenues for Youth<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
            <p class="recipient-row__fact">The 2024 report records 6 laptops donated to New Avenues for Youth.</p>
            <span class="recipient-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a class="impact-recipients__source" href="https://getlagosnow.com/annual-benefit-report-2024/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source: 2024 Annual Benefit Report <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 08 Published annual benefit reports -->
    <section class="impact-reports section" aria-labelledby="reports-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="impact-reports__head reveal">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Accountability &amp; transparency</p>
            <h2 id="reports-title" class="h2">Our progress,<br>shared openly.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Meaningful commitments deserve transparency. Explore our published reports to learn more about community contributions, environmental efforts, and ongoing goals.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="report-list">
          <a class="report-row reveal" href="reports/annual-benefit-2025.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span class="report-row__year">2025</span>
            <span class="report-row__body"><strong>Annual Benefit Report</strong><span>Community contributions, E-Recycling PDX, and People and Planet First verification reported in March 2026.</span></span>
            <span class="report-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
          </a>
          <a class="report-row reveal" href="reports/annual-benefit-2024.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span class="report-row__year">2024</span>
            <span class="report-row__body"><strong>Annual Benefit Report</strong><span>Documented company contributions, device donations, volunteer hours, and miles.</span></span>
            <span class="report-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
          </a>
          <a class="report-row reveal" href="reports/annual-benefit-2023.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span class="report-row__year">2023</span>
            <span class="report-row__body"><strong>Annual Benefit Report</strong><span>Community donations, E-Recycling PDX, and volunteerism.</span></span>
            <span class="report-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"/></svg></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 09 Approved shared red CTA -->
